WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:25.817
POLICE RADIO: TWO MALE
(BLEEP) ON MOTORBIKES WITH

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:29.196
WALKIE-TALKIES IN THE VICINITY
OF 5900 BLOCK SOUTH AVALON.

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:33.534
IN THE WATTS AREA, FIFTY-TWO
CHEVROLET WHITE, IN COLOR.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:37.204
CONTAINING FOUR MALE (BLEEP)
WITH A SAWED-OFF SHOTGUN.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:39.289
RESERVE THE LOOTED STORE AREA.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.875
FOUR MALE (BLEEP) IN A
'52 CHEVY WHITE COLOR

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.960
WITH SAWED-OFF SHOTGUNS.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.670
WATTS AREA.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.380
DISPATCHER:
ALL HOLLENBECK UNITS,

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.132
BE ON THE ALERT
FOR MOLOTOV COCKTAILS.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:50.342
ALL HOLLENBECK UNITS,

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:52.552
BE ON THE ALERT FOR
MOLOTOV COCKTAILS.

00:00:56.098 --> 00:01:02.271
 [SCREAMING]

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:09.736
 [INAUDIBLE POLICE RADIO]

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:18.120
 [SIRENS]

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:32.676
♪ ♪

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.309
REPORTER:
THIS IS WHERE IT BEGAN.

00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:42.269
THIS IS WHERE THE
FUSE WAS LIGHTED.

00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:44.438
IT BEGAN WITH THE ARREST
BY WHITE OFFICERS OF THE

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:47.649
CALIFORNIA HIGHWAY PATROL
OF TWO YOUNG NEGROES.

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:49.443
ONE, ON A CHARGE OF
DRUNK DRIVING; THE OTHER,

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:51.445
HIS BROTHER; HIS PASSENGER.

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:53.405
THEIR MOTHER, WHO LIVES
NEARBY, CAME TO THE SCENE.

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.449
THERE WAS AN ARGUMENT;
THERE WAS A SCUFFLE.

00:01:55.449 --> 00:01:57.909
BY THEN THE CROWD OF SEVERAL
HUNDRED NEGROES HAD GATHERED,

00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:00.120
AND THE STORY OF POLICE
BRUTALITY QUICKLY SPREAD

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.997
THROUGH THE COMMUNITY.

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:04.583
REPORTER: UP THE STREET, A
BLOCK OR SO IN THAT DIRECTION,

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:07.336
A CHURCH, WHERE NEGRO
LEADERS PLEADED FOR PEACE

00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:08.837
AND WERE REJECTED.

00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:11.632
DOWN THAT WAY, THE BUSY
INTERSECTION WHERE CARS WERE

00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:14.509
OVERTURNED AND BURNED; WHERE
A TELEVISION TECHNICIAN WAS

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:17.346
PULLED FROM HIS WAGON, AND
ALMOST BEATEN TO DEATH.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:20.807
REPORTER: IT WAS
THE MOST WIDESPREAD,

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:23.852
MOST DESTRUCTIVE RACIAL
VIOLENCE IN AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.232
THE BURNING AND LOOTING, THE
SHOOTING AND BEATING WENT ON

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:30.859
FOR NEARLY A WEEK.

00:02:30.859 --> 00:02:34.905
34 PERSONS WERE KILLED,
ALL BUT 5 OF THEM NEGROES.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.158
REPORTER: POLICE CHIEF
PARKER DESCRIBED LOS ANGELES

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.452
NEGRO RIOTERS AS
"MONKEYS IN A ZOO."

00:02:40.452 --> 00:02:42.120
AND NEGRO LEADERS
HAVE MORE THAN ONCE CALLED

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.622
FOR HIS REMOVAL.

00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:45.749
REPORTER: IN CREATING
THE SITUATION,

00:02:45.749 --> 00:02:47.209
WHERE WAS THE FAILURE?

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:49.461
IN THE PART OF THE CITY,
THE COUNTY, THE SCHOOLS?

00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:51.671
CHIEF PARKER: THIS, I THINK,
IS ONE OF THE DIFFICULTIES IN

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.174
MEETING THIS IS THAT WE'RE
TRYING TO FIND A FAILURE OTHER

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.842
THAN THE PEOPLE THEMSELVES.

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:57.844
NOW THIS IS A VERY
DANGEROUS MOVE BECAUSE IT,

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.223
IT SERVES TO SORT OF
SANCTIFY THEIR ACTS.

00:03:01.223 --> 00:03:03.433
JOHN SHABAZ: EVERY
GRIEVANCE THAT WAS HAD BY

00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:05.644
THE PEOPLE WHO
STARTED THIS THING,

00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:07.354
THERE HAS BEEN NOTHING
DONE TO SOLVE IT.

00:03:07.354 --> 00:03:09.648
THE ONLY THING THAT WAS
DONE WAS THAT MASSIVE FORCES

00:03:09.648 --> 00:03:13.568
WERE BROUGHT IN TO SUPPRESS
THE ACTUAL OVERT ACTION.

00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:15.362
REPORTER: HOW HAS
IT AFFECTED YOU?

00:03:15.362 --> 00:03:17.155
MAN: JUST GETTING TIRED OF
BEING PUSHED AROUND BY YOU

00:03:17.155 --> 00:03:18.448
WHITE PEOPLE, THAT'S ALL.

00:03:18.448 --> 00:03:19.866
REPORTER: HOW PUSHED AROUND?

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:20.909
HOW BADLY?

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:22.119
IN WHAT WAY?

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:24.204
MAN: JUST STOPPING US ON THE
STREET, KICKING IN THE DOORS,

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.330
TAKEN DOWN TO THE
POLICE STATION,

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.040
THEY KICKING YOUR TEETH IN.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.708
REPORTER: WELL THEY'RE
STOPPING PEOPLE ON THE STREET

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.210
NOW, BUT I MEAN, THEY
WEREN'T STOPPING PEOPLE IN

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.294
THE STREET WHEN THIS STARTED.

00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:33.255
MAN: OH YEAH, BUT I'M
NOT THINKING ABOUT NOW.

00:03:33.255 --> 00:03:35.215
OH, THEY'VE BEEN DOING IT
A LONG TIME BEFORE NOW.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.217
TOM NEWSOME: DURING
THIS ENTIRE INCIDENT,

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.553
WE'VE HEARD CONSTANT
REFERENCES TO RESPECT FOR

00:03:39.553 --> 00:03:41.930
LAW AND ORDER, AND
MORE PARTICULARLY,

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:45.183
WHAT THEY MEAN IS RESPECT
FOR LAW ENFORCEMENT.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:48.520
NOW TO REALLY UNDERSTAND
THE PROBLEMS OF THESE PEOPLE,

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.606
YOU'D HAVE TO UNDERSTAND
WHAT LAW ENFORCEMENT HAS

00:03:51.606 --> 00:03:54.109
MEANT TO THEM
FOR A HUNDRED YEARS.

00:03:54.109 --> 00:03:56.695
WE'RE TALKING ABOUT THE WHITE
MAN'S LAW ENFORCEMENT THAT'S

00:03:56.695 --> 00:03:59.322
RESPONSIBLE FOR MANY OF
THEIR PARENTS BEING CHASED

00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:02.117
OUT OF THE SOUTH
ON ONE PRETEXT OR ANOTHER.

00:04:02.117 --> 00:04:05.412
UNDER THOSE CONDITIONS YOU
CAN UNDERSTAND THAT THE PEOPLE

00:04:05.412 --> 00:04:08.290
AREN'T GOING TO BE REVERENT
ABOUT LAW ENFORCEMENT AND

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:11.126
THE MEN WHO ENFORCE THE LAW.

00:04:11.126 --> 00:04:12.419
REPORTER: WHAT WOULD
MAKE IT BETTER?

00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:14.921
WHAT WOULD MAKE ALL
THE RIOTING STOP?

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:17.382
MAN: I DON'T THINK
IT'D EVER STOP, REALLY.

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:19.676
REPORTER: NEVER?

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:21.928
MAN: I MEAN, IT MAY
NOT BE LIKE THIS,

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:24.389
BUT IT'LL NEVER STOP.

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:26.475
I DON'T THINK.

00:04:26.475 --> 00:04:28.560
BILL STOUT: THE MCCONE
COMMISSION SOUGHT TO ANSWER

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.103
QUESTIONS ABOUT WATTS.

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.354
CAN IT HAPPEN AGAIN?

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:33.982
SO SERIOUS AND EXPLOSIVE
IS THE SITUATION,

00:04:33.982 --> 00:04:36.776
SAYS THE COMMISSION, THAT
UNLESS IT IS CHECKED,

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:39.696
THE AUGUST RIOTS MAY
BE ONLY A CURTAIN RAISER TO

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:43.033
WHAT COULD BLOW UP
ONE DAY IN THE FUTURE.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.160
WHAT SHALL IT
AVAIL OUR NATION,

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.412
IF WE CAN PLACE A
MAN ON THE MOON,

00:04:47.412 --> 00:04:51.124
BUT CANNOT CURE THE
SICKNESS IN OUR CITIES?

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:53.251
THIS IS BILL STOUT
FOR CBS REPORTS,

00:04:53.251 --> 00:04:55.462
IN LOS ANGELES, GOOD NIGHT.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:05:01.176
 ♪ [THEME MUSIC PLAYS] ♪

00:05:01.176 --> 00:05:03.803
MARTIN LUTHER KING JR: OUT OF
THE ASHES OF THIS COMMUNITY I

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:06.973
THINK THAT IS AN OPPORTUNITY
TO BUILD A BETTER SOCIETY IN

00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:10.644
TERMS OF ECONOMIC SECURITY,
BETTER HOUSING CONDITIONS,

00:05:10.644 --> 00:05:14.689
BETTER SCHOOLS, AND TO DEAL
WITH THE POLICE PROBLEM TO

00:05:14.689 --> 00:05:19.069
MAKE LOS ANGELES A MODEL
CITY FOR THE NATION.

00:05:21.488 --> 00:05:23.782
REPORTER: THOMAS BRADLEY
WAS SWORN IN TODAY AS MAYOR

00:05:23.782 --> 00:05:25.659
OF LOS ANGELES, THE LARGEST
CITY IN THIS COUNTRY

00:05:25.659 --> 00:05:27.619
EVER TO HAVE A BLACK MAYOR.

00:05:27.619 --> 00:05:29.496
BRADLEY IS A FORMER
POLICEMAN AND THE SON OF

00:05:29.496 --> 00:05:31.414
A TEXAS SHARECROPPER.

00:05:31.414 --> 00:05:32.541
 [APPLAUSE].

00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:34.668
TOM BRADLEY: TONIGHT
IS NOT JUST A VICTORY FOR

00:05:34.668 --> 00:05:36.461
TOM BRADLEY, BUT A
VICTORY FOR PROGRESS,

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:38.171
A VICTORY FOR OUR CHILDREN.

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:39.381
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:41.758
 [APPLAUSE].

00:05:44.427 --> 00:05:46.513
REPORTER: DARYL GATES
HAD SPENT 28 YEARS WORKING

00:05:46.513 --> 00:05:48.848
HIS WAY THROUGH THE
RANKS TO THE TOP JOB.

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:51.017
REPORTER 2: HE HAD BEEN CHIEF
PARKER'S DRIVER AND BODYGUARD,

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.227
HIS HEIR APPARENT.

00:05:52.227 --> 00:05:54.521
DARYL GATES: I'M GONNA PUT
MY STAMP ON THIS ORGANIZATION.

00:05:54.521 --> 00:05:56.565
THIS WILL BE A DARYL
GATES DEPARTMENT.

00:05:56.565 --> 00:06:00.443
 [INAUDIBLE RIOT BANTER].

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.530
REPORTER: BLACKS AND
LIBERALS HAVE BECOME INTENSELY

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.533
CRITICAL OF WHAT THEY CHARGE
IS EXCESSIVE USE OF FORCE

00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:08.535
BY THE LOS ANGELES
POLICE DEPARTMENT.

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:11.538
WOMAN: DARYL GATES IS
CAUSING THE KIND OF POLARIZATION

00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:13.748
THAT IS DANGEROUS.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.877
REPORTER: MANY AMERICANS THINK
OF HOLLYWOOD WHEN THEY THINK

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:21.298
OF LOS ANGELES BUT LOS ANGELES
IS ALSO THE PORT OF ENTRY FOR

00:06:21.298 --> 00:06:23.049
AMERICA'S NEW
IMMIGRANTS FROM ASIA AND

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:24.384
FROM LATIN AMERICA.

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:25.927
MAN: OF THE
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA.

00:06:25.927 --> 00:06:28.680
CROWD: OF THE UNITED
STATES OF AMERICA.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.432
REPORTER: IN THE
LAST FIFTEEN YEARS,

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:32.392
MORE THAN TWO MILLION
IMMIGRANTS FROM AROUND THE

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:34.936
WORLD HAVE POURED
INTO THE CITY.

00:06:34.936 --> 00:06:37.480
MANY OF THE CITY'S NEW SMALL
BUSINESSES ARE THE AMERICAN

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.400
DREAM OF THE FOREIGN BORN.

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:44.237
TOM BRADLEY: OUR CITY
IS A STUNNING ETHNIC

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:47.657
AND CULTURAL MOSAIC.

00:06:47.657 --> 00:06:50.243
WE HAVE FORGED A SENSE
OF IDENTITY OF COMMON

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:52.579
CONCERN AND DESTINY.

00:06:52.579 --> 00:06:55.040
IN THE LATE DR. MARTIN
LUTHER KING'S WORDS,

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:59.085
"I'M HONORED TO STAND HERE
TODAY AND LOOK OUT UPON FACES

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:02.631
OF MANY DIFFERENT
COLORS INTERMINGLE LIKE THE

00:07:02.631 --> 00:07:04.758
WATERS OF A RIVER.

00:07:04.758 --> 00:07:09.054
YET I SEE ONLY ONE FACE,
THE FACE OF THE FUTURE."

00:07:09.804 --> 00:07:11.348
THANK YOU.

00:07:11.348 --> 00:07:15.143
 [APPLAUSE].

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:25.195
 [EXPLOSIONS, GUNFIRE].

00:07:42.879 --> 00:07:45.423
PRESIDENT BUSH:
ONE, TWO, THREE.

00:07:45.799 --> 00:07:50.053
I AM PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE
THAT AT MIDNIGHT TONIGHT ALL

00:07:50.053 --> 00:07:53.807
UNITED STATES AND COALITION
FORCES WILL SUSPEND

00:07:53.807 --> 00:07:57.143
OFFENSIVE COMBAT OPERATIONS.

00:07:57.769 --> 00:08:00.188
THIS IS A NOT A
TIME OF EUPHORIA,

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:02.816
CERTAINLY NOT A TIME TO GLOAT.

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:06.820
BUT IT IS A TIME OF PRIDE,
PRIDE IN OUR TROOPS,

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:10.115
PRIDE IN OUR NATION AND THE
PEOPLE WHOSE STRENGTH AND

00:08:10.115 --> 00:08:14.869
RESOLVE MADE VICTORY
QUICK, DECISIVE, AND JUST.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.003
REPORTER: UH, THIS LATEST
GALLUP POLL SHOWS PEOPLE IN

00:08:24.003 --> 00:08:26.631
THE UNITED STATES FEELING
POSITIVE ABOUT THEIR COUNTRY

00:08:26.631 --> 00:08:28.883
AND THEIR PRESIDENT
FOLLOWING THE ALLIED VICTORY

00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:29.884
IN THE GULF.

00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:31.970
66% OF THOSE QUESTIONED
SAY THEY ARE SATISFIED.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:33.847
REPORTER: BEGINNING
NEXT FRIDAY, L.A. RESIDENTS

00:08:33.847 --> 00:08:35.598
WILL HAVE TO DRINK, SHOWER,

00:08:35.598 --> 00:08:36.933
AND CONSUME 10% LESS WATER.

00:08:36.933 --> 00:08:39.644
MAYOR BRADLEY SIGNED THE WATER
CONSERVATION MEASURE TODAY.

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:41.521
KFI NEWS TIME IS 7:06.

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:43.189
REPORTER: THE ECONOMY
LOOKS NONE TOO GOOD.

00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:45.150
IN FACT, UH, THEY KEEP
SAYING THAT THE RECESSION IS

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.360
THE ONLY THING PULLING US
OUT OF INFLATION RIGHT NOW.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.737
REPORTER: 57 DEGREES.

00:08:48.737 --> 00:08:50.029
FULLERTON, CLOUDY AND 61.

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:51.406
LONG BEACH, PARTLY
CLOUDY AND 60.

00:08:51.406 --> 00:08:56.202
AND LANCASTER, PARTLY CLOUDY,
65 DEGREES HERE AT KFI AM 640.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.755
POLICE RADIO: WE ARE
SOUTHBOUND ON PAXTON,

00:09:06.755 --> 00:09:08.715
ABOUT 50 MILES PER HOUR.

00:09:08.715 --> 00:09:10.717
THERE'S, UH, APPEARS,
APPEARS TO BE THREE MALE BLACKS

00:09:10.717 --> 00:09:11.718
IN A VEHICLE.

00:09:11.718 --> 00:09:13.720
IT'S A WHITE, UH,
HYUNDAI, I BELIEVE.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.347
POLICE 2: [INAUDIBLE]
WE'RE SOUTHBOUND ON FOOTHILL

00:09:16.347 --> 00:09:17.390
FROM VAN NUYS.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.392
THE VEHICLE STOPPED AT
THE LIGHT BUT FAILED TO YIELD

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:20.602
TO THE, UH, POLICE UNIT.

00:09:20.602 --> 00:09:21.936
POLICE 3: 23.

00:09:21.936 --> 00:09:23.396
WE'RE, UH, FOLLOWING THE UNIT.

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:24.856
WE'RE AT
[INAUDIBLE] NORTHBOUND.

00:09:24.856 --> 00:09:26.232
[INAUDIBLE] EASTBOUND.

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:29.778
 [HELICOPTER].

00:09:44.084 --> 00:09:46.085
 [HELICOPTER]

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:14.948
DAN RATHER: AN UNUSUAL
TWIST IN A CASE OF ALLEGED

00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:18.368
RACE-BASED POLICE
BRUTALITY IN LOS ANGELES.

00:10:18.368 --> 00:10:21.746
NEITHER THE POLICE NOR THE
SUSPECT KNEW THAT A HOME VIDEO

00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:24.123
CAMERA HAD CAPTURED THE SCENE.

00:10:24.123 --> 00:10:26.626
REPORTER: IT BEGAN AS A
HIGH-SPEED CHASE AND ENDED

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:28.336
EARLY SUNDAY MORNING
WITH THE MOTORIST,

00:10:28.336 --> 00:10:30.964
A BLACK MALE BEING
BRUTALLY BEATEN AND KICKED.

00:10:30.964 --> 00:10:33.466
REPORTER: THE VICTIM WAS
STRUCK AS MANY AS 56 TIMES,

00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:35.134
AND SUFFERED SEVERAL
BROKEN BONES.

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:38.137
LAWYER: 56 TIMES.

00:10:38.137 --> 00:10:41.516
THAT'S WHAT THE AMERICAN
PUBLIC SAW ON VIDEOTAPE.

00:10:42.267 --> 00:10:44.978
REPORTER: GEORGE HOLLIDAY
LIVES ACROSS THE STREET.

00:10:44.978 --> 00:10:47.981
HE HAD HIS VIDEO CAMERA OUT
AND RECORDED WHAT HAPPENED AS

00:10:47.981 --> 00:10:50.400
THE SUSPECT WAS
BEING ARRESTED.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.235
GEORGE HOLLIDAY: GOT MY
CAMERA SORT OF READY AND LOOKED

00:10:52.235 --> 00:10:54.279
ACROSS THE STREET AND
THAT'S WHEN I SAW THAT THE

00:10:54.279 --> 00:10:55.822
ACTION WAS GOING ON.

00:10:55.822 --> 00:10:57.323
CNN REPORTER: THE
SUSPECT IDENTIFIED AS

00:10:57.323 --> 00:10:58.533
RODNEY GLEN KING.

00:10:58.533 --> 00:11:01.119
REPORTER: KING, WHO IS MARRIED
AND HAS TWO STEP CHILDREN,

00:11:01.119 --> 00:11:03.830
WAS ON PAROLE AFTER SERVING
TIME FOR ARMED ROBBERY.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.999
HIS WIFE SAYS THAT'S NO
EXCUSE FOR WHAT HAPPENED.

00:11:05.999 --> 00:11:07.292
CRYSTAL KING: IT WAS
A TRAFFIC VIOLATION.

00:11:07.292 --> 00:11:09.002
HOW COME THEY JUST COULDN'T
ARREST HIM AND GIVE HIM SOME

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.837
KIND OF FINE OR SOMETHING?

00:11:10.837 --> 00:11:12.839
WHY DID THEY HAVE TO BEAT
THE MESS OUT OF HIM LIKE THAT?

00:11:12.839 --> 00:11:15.008
REPORTER: DOCTORS SAID THAT
HE SUFFERED A CONCUSSION.

00:11:15.008 --> 00:11:17.343
ONE OF HIS EYE SOCKETS
WAS PULVERIZED.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:20.847
HIS CHEEKBONE WAS SO PUSHED
IN FROM THE BLOWS TO HIS FACE

00:11:20.847 --> 00:11:23.558
THAT IT WOULD REQUIRE
RECONSTRUCTIVE SURGERY.

00:11:23.558 --> 00:11:24.767
STEVEN LERMAN: FROM
WHAT I'VE SEEN,

00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:26.853
NONE OF THE PRISONERS
OF WAR FROM AMERICAN FORCES

00:11:26.853 --> 00:11:29.439
TAKEN BY SADDAM HUSSEIN
CAME BACK BEATEN THAT BADLY.

00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:31.816
REPORTER: LOS ANGELES
POLICE SAY THE INCIDENT WAS

00:11:31.816 --> 00:11:33.860
NOT RACIALLY MOTIVATED,
BUT THE BLACK COMMUNITY IS

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.236
NOT BUYING THAT.

00:11:35.236 --> 00:11:37.864
ABOUT 300 MEMBERS
OF THE NAACP MARCHED ON

00:11:37.864 --> 00:11:39.991
POLICE HEADQUARTERS TODAY.

00:11:39.991 --> 00:11:41.701
 [PROTESTORS
 CHANTING INAUDIBLY].

00:11:41.701 --> 00:11:43.202
DARYL GATES: THIS
